---
category: cake
cook_time: 25 min
difficulty: easy
prep_time: 15 min
servings: 12
title: Hazelnut brownies
---

Pre-heat the oven to 180°C. Butter a 20 x 30 cm #baking tin{}.

Melt the @salted butter{175%g}.

Mix the melted butter, the @eggs{4}, the @flour{80%g}, the @salt{1%pinch}, the @sugar{350%g} and the @cocoa powder{80%g}.

Coarsely crush the @hazelnuts{50%g}.
Add the hazelnuts and the @chocolate chips{150%g} (or broken pieces of dark baking chocolate if you don't have chips).

Pour the batter into the tin.

Bake for ~{20-25%minutes}.

After baking, let cool before unmolding.
